      <MissionDesc>WOMEN IN ANIMATION IS THE ONLY ORGANIZATION DEDICATED TO BUILDING A WORLD WHERE WOMEN SHARE EQUALLY IN THE CREATION, PRODUCTION AND REWARDS OF ANIMATION, AND WE PROVIDE RESOURCES AND CONNECTIONS TO MAKE IT HAPPEN.</MissionDesc>
